Package: njord
Title: Design Parametric Windstorm Covers for Regions of the UK
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Michael", "Campbell", , "m.campbell@tutanota.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parametric windstorm cover design and basis risk measurement
    for regions of the UK, using public data. Builds a modelled loss for
    each storm from the Copernicus ERA5 windstorm footprints, LitPop asset
    values and a published damage curve. Sets the attachment and
    exhaustion of a linear-ramp cover over a layer of those losses by one
    of three calibration rules, and measures basis risk against what the
    layer would have recovered, in sample and out of sample by storm
    season.
